\par\par \b \uc2 News Highlights: Top Global Markets News of the Day\b0\par\par\uc2 398 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2020\par 18:00\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2020, Dow Jones & Company, Inc. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par U.S. Eyes \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in Saudi-\f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Russia\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Oil Standoff \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The Trump administration is considering \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervening\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the Saudi-Russian oil-price war with a diplomatic push to get the Saudis to cut oil production and threats of sanctions on Russia aimed at stabilizing markets, according to people familiar with the matter. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par U.S. Stocks Gain Amid \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central Bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Action \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The S&P 500 recovered some ground as the \f28 \uc2 \f2 Federal Reserve\f28 \uc2 \f2  and \f28 \uc2 \f2 ECB\f28 \uc2 \f2  introduced fresh measures to shield the global economy from the coronavirus pandemic. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Trump Says U.S. Will Cut Red Tape to Advance Virus Therapies \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 President Trump said that he is directing the \f28 \uc2 \f2 Food and Drug Administration\f28 \uc2 \f2  to eliminate red tape to more quickly develop therapies to help patients diagnosed with the coronavirus. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Bank of England\f28 \uc2 \f2  Cuts Rates Further, Restarts Bond Purchases \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The BOE cut its benchmark interest rate to a record low and said it would buy $232 billion of \f28 \uc2 \f2 U.K. government\f28 \uc2 \f2  bonds, in the latest push by a major \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to combat the economic damage from the coronavirus. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Companies Are Suspending Dividends Because of the Coronavirus \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Funding strains and sliding sales are forcing a growing number of companies to slash or suspend their dividend payouts. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Jobless Claims Rise Sharply \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The number of Americans applying for first-time unemployment benefits increased sharply last week, the front end of a surge in claims tied to the new coronavirus pandemic. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Federal Reserve  Establishes \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Swap Lines With Nine More Countries \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The \f28 \uc2 \f2 Federal Reserve\f28 \uc2 \f2  said it would establish a temporary program to help lend dollars to nine central banks to alleviate ongoing strains in financial markets. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par What Price Collapse? U.S. Producers Keep Pumping. \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 U.S. energy producers responded to one of the worst weeks ever for oil prices by pumping as much crude from the ground as they ever have before. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Stress on Italian Bonds Eases After ECB Emergency Action \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Yields on strained Italian government bonds fell in response to the \f28 \uc2 \f2 European \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central Bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  's emergency stimulus plan, partially filling in a dangerous fault line in the region's financial markets. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Fed's Repo \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Operations\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  See Light Response Amid Upward Rate Pressure \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The Fed implemented two repurchase agreement \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 operations\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  that saw demand well short of the loans the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  was willing to extend.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 March 19, 2020 13:00 ET (17:00 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020200319eg3j004oa\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
