\par\par \b \uc2 *Bank of Russia Sees Average 2016 Oil Price At $25 Under Risk Scenario\b0\par\par\uc2 252 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 Februar 2016\par 10:49\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2016, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 12 Feb 2016 04:49 ET *Bank of Russia Sees Average Oil Price At $35 In 2017-18 Under Risk Scenario\par \par \uc2 12 Feb 2016 04:49 ET *Bank of Russia First Deputy Chairman Tulin Speaking to Reporters\par \par \uc2 12 Feb 2016 05:00 ET *Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2  Tulin: \b \highlight22\uc2 FX Interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  Won't Help to Stabilize Ruble for Long\par \par \uc2 12 Feb 2016 05:29 ET  Bank of Russia Lowers 2016 Oil Price Forecasts to $25 a Barrel\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par    By Andrey Ostroukh \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 MOSCOW--The Bank of Russia has lowered its oil price forecasts, preparing for an average oil price of $25 a barrel this year, the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's first deputy chairman said Friday.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Speaking to reporters, \f28 \uc2 \f2 Dmitry Tulin\f28 \uc2 \f2  said that the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's new risk scenario envisages the price of crude will recover to an average of $35 in 2017 and 2018.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The bank's previous risk scenario for an average price of $35 a barrel has effectively become the base scenario, according to Mr. Tulin. The bank will present its new set of forecasts after a board meeting, scheduled for March 18.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Mr. Tulin also said that selling foreign \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  from reserves won't help stabilize the sinking ruble for long. His comment underpins the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's reluctance to save the ruble from hitting record lows.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Write to Andrey Ostroukh at andrey.ostroukh@wsj.com\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 February 12, 2016 05:29 ET (10:29 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020160212ec2c0015k\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
