\par\par \b \uc2 Russia  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Says On Guard Against Ruble Volatility\b0\par\par\uc2 By Andrey Ostroukh   \par \uc2 341 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 Januar 2016\par 11:16\par \uc2 Dow Jones Newswires Chinese (English)\par \uc2 RTNW\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2016, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 MOSCOW--The Bank of Russia would try to douse any excessive volatility in the ruble while it has the tools to mitigate any risks to the country's financial stability, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's governor said Friday.\par \par \uc2 "We have full set of tools to act proactively and avoid threats to financial stability," Elvira Nabiullina said, without elaborating.\par \par \uc2 This latest verbal \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  comes the day after the ruble fell to a new lower against of 86 versus the dollar.\par \par \uc2 The ruble's crash on Thursday followed comments from the Bank of Russia that the depreciation was justified and carried no risks to financial stability. The statement was taken by the market as a direct indication that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has no immediate plans to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stem the decline in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  hasn't supported the ruble since late 2014. It let the ruble float freely from Nov. 10 of that year and eliminated regular \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  after spending several dozen billions of dollars from its reserves. Since then the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2  has said it would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  only if there are risks to financial stability.\par \par \uc2 On Friday, the ruble paired some losses as prices for oil recovered a little of recent lost ground, rising above $30 a barrel. The ruble gained more than 2% to 80.82 against the dollar as of 0852 GMT on Friday.\par \par \uc2 Speaking at a meeting with government officials and economist at the finance ministry headquarters in Moscow, Ms. Nabiullina said that oil prices remain the key factor for the Russian economy, which derives much of its revenue from oil and gas exports.\par \par \uc2 Crude prices are unlikely to return to high levels seen only a couple of years ago, she said.\par \par \uc2 Ms. Nabiullina canceled a planned visit to the \uc2 World Economic Forum\uc2  in Davos in Switzerland this week, a person familiar with her schedule said.\par \par \uc2 Write to Andrey Ostroukh at andrey.ostroukh@wsj.com\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 22-01-16 1016GMT\par \par \uc2 Dokument RTNW000020160122ec1m0009e\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
