\par\par \b \uc2 *Bank Of Russia Deputy Head: Ruble May Firm if US Fed Hikes Rate as Expected\b0\par\par\uc2 258 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 September 2015\par 13:37\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2015, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 17 Sep 2015 08:18 ET  Bank of Russia Deputy Head: Ruble May Firm If US Fed Raises Rates\par \par \uc2 By Andrey Ostroukh\par \par \uc2 KAZAN, Russia--The Russian ruble could firm if the \uc2 U.S. Federal Reserve\uc2  raises interest rates, as expected, the Bank of Russia's first deputy chairman said Thursday.\par \par \uc2 The Fed\uc2  is widely expected to raise interest rates for the first time in almost 10 years on Thursday. In theory, such a move should boost the appeal of U.S. assets and trigger outflows from emerging markets, hitting the ruble.\par \par \uc2 But people "buy on rumors and sell on facts," so the expected increase could support the ruble, \uc2 Sergei Shvetsov\uc2  told reporters on the sidelines of a banking conference in the city of Kazan. Mr. Shvetsov added that what the Fed says in its rate comment will be of key importance.\par \par \uc2 The ruble had eased 0.7% to 65.78 rubles against the dollar as of 1152 GMT, a long way from the Russian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's record low of around 80 rubles to the dollar hit in late 2014.\par \par \uc2 Earlier on Thursday, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Chairwoman \uc2 Elvira Nabiullina\uc2  said the ruble was close to fair level. She also said the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2  is ready to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in financial markets should a possible rate increase by the Fed cause excessive volatility.\par \par \uc2 Write to Andrey Ostroukh at andrey.ostroukh@wsj.com\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 September 17, 2015 08:18 ET (12:18 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020150917eb9h00192\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
