\par\par \b \uc2 Russian  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Buys $150 Million to Boost Reserves\b0\par\par\uc2 By Andrey Ostroukh   \par \uc2 227 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 Juni 2015\par 09:50\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2015, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 MOSCOW--The Bank of Russia bought $150 million for the country's international reserves on Monday, data showed Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which reports its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  with a two-day lag, started buying foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  on May 13 in an attempt to replenish depleted reserves. Since the \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  started, the bank has bought as much as $2.68 billion.\par \par \uc2 The daily amount of \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  account for less than 5% of average turnover on the Moscow exchange, but in the absence of other news the purchases limit the ruble's upside. After buying $200 million a day, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  trimmed \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Monday as the ruble had weakened.\par \par \uc2 Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2  is topping up foreign-\b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves after it spent billions of dollars to defend the ruble over the past year. The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was hitting record lows almost daily in late 2014 because of the decline in the price of oil and economic sanctions imposed on Russia by the West following the annexation of Crimea and Moscow's support for separatists in eastern Ukraine.\par \par \uc2 In early trade on Wednesday, the ruble was down 0.5% to 53.05 versus the dollar.\par \par \uc2 Write to Andrey Ostroukh at andrey.ostroukh@wsj.com\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 June 03, 2015 03:50 ET (07:50 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020150603eb63000oq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
